### API测试文件 - 使用 REST Client 扩展

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = 

### 1. 登录获取 Token (必须先执行)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 2. 获取当前用户信息 (API-001)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. 更新当前用户信息 (API-002)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "测试用户",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "avatar": "https://example.com/avatar.jpg"
}

### 4. 获取商品列表 (用于找商品ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/commerce/products?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 获取商品详情 (API-003) - 替换 {id} 为实际商品ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/commerce/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 创建订单 (API-004)
POST {{baseUrl}}/commerce/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "productName": "测试商品",
      "quantity": 2,
      "price": 99.9,
      "selectedSpecs": "{\"颜色\":\"黑色\",\"尺寸\":\"M\"}",
      "image": "https://example.com/product.jpg"
    }
  ],
  "totalAmount": 199.8,
  "remark": "测试订单",
  "receiverName": "张三",
  "receiverPhone": "13800138000",
  "province": "广东省",
  "city": "深圳市",
  "district": "南山区",
  "addressDetail": "科技园XX路XX号"
}

### 7. 获取我的订单列表 (API-005)
GET {{baseUrl}}/commerce/orders/my?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. 获取类目列表 (API-006)
GET {{baseUrl}}/commerce/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. 文件上传 (API-008) - 需要手动选择文件
POST {{baseUrl}}/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

测试文件内容
------WebKitFormBoundary--
